WEBVTT

00:00:00.982 --> 00:00:08.607
Indication and devices. The DBS indication sets which clinical and session scales are offered later. Here, OCD.

00:00:12.176 --> 00:00:17.340
Then the anatomical target. The button beside each list edits its choices.

00:00:22.706 --> 00:00:30.308
The lead model is drawn to scale in the next steps. When the two leads differ, untick Same lead on both sides.

00:00:36.135 --> 00:00:40.684
The implanted pulse generator, or IPG, is chosen the same way.

00:00:44.685 --> 00:00:51.324
Devices settings adds manufacturers, leads and IPGs, and the design of each lead.

00:00:57.986 --> 00:01:00.689
Next goes on to the initial assessment.

